window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Real wolves bite...</p> <p>I was taught my whole life about the importance of true mates, how when you find that one wolf for you, everything falls into place.</p> <p>Everyone who taught me that was a liar.</p> <p>When I found my true mate, happily ever after sure as hell didn't start, but hell definitely began.</p> <p>I ran away, and now I've been searching for peace for weeks as I drive around the country.</p> <p>I didn't mean to take the wrong road.</p> <p>I didn't mean to make it to that small town.</p> <p>And I didn't mean to meet two men, who set me and my wolf on fire.</p> <p>But here I am somehow, and peace is the last thing I've found.</p> <p>And don't forget about the serial killer...</p> <p>This is a rejected mate series, filled with scorching hot wolf shifters who take what they want, enough steam to burn you up, and a hidden town filled with secrets. You'll love this paranormal romance if you love <i>True Blood</i>, <i>Twilight</i>, or <i>Vampire Diaries</i>.</p> <p><i>Wild Moon</i> is book one in a new wolf shifter trilogy by C.R. Jane and Mila Young.</p> <p>Listen in order:</p> <ul> <li><i>Wild Moon</i></li> <li><i>Wild Heart</i></li> <li><i>Wild Girl</i></li> <li><i>Wild Love</i></li> </ul> <p>More to come...</p>"; 
